)//2 = 9//2 = 4, tail = 11-3-4 = 4 → \"abcd...wxyz\" ✓\n\nUnicode test: \"甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸\" max_len=6 → head=2, tail=1 → \"甲乙...癸\" ✓\ntest_truncate_middle_unicode \"日本語テスト文字列\" max_len=7 → head=2, tail=2 → \"日本...文字列\" ✓\n\nNow min_len=5 guaranteed, so tail = max_len-3-head >= max_len-3-(max_len-3+1)//2. For max_len=5, tail=1. Good.\n\nWrite implementation.\n\nNote test_string_edges imports `string_utils as strings` and uses strings.truncate_middle.\n\nLet me write."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 3754, "completion_tokens": 844, "total_tokens": 4598, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 432}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 3114}, "system_fingerprint": "aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}}
